.TH WRITEV 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
writev \- write bytes from multiple buffers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/uio.h>
.B ssize_t writev(int descriptor, const struct iovec* vectors, int count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes the buffers in the iovec array in order. Each entry contains an
iov_base pointer and iov_len byte count. Writes can be short.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns bytes written, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR readv (3crunch),
.BR writev (2)
